# Go and Nix files whose text a check outside CI's docs lane reads, comments
# included (issue #5158). ci-changes.sh never lets a comment edit to one of
# these take the docs lane. One bash glob per line; `*` crosses `/`. The
# ci-comment-readers-cover-checks guard in nix/checks/default.nix fails when a
# module outside docsCheckModules names a .go/.nix file not matched here.
